### Phase 28 smoke tests
### Login first and set ADMIN_TOKEN manually if your REST client does not share browser cookies.
@apiBase = http://localhost:4000
@ADMIN_TOKEN = paste-admin-access-token-here

### Verify provider roles endpoint
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/provider-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Verify provider directory no longer fails on ProviderProfile.roleCatalogId
GET {{apiBase}}/api/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Verify provider queue no longer fails on ProviderProfile.roleCatalogId
GET {{apiBase}}/api/providers/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Verify payment summary no longer cascades ProviderProfile.roleCatalogId failure
GET {{apiBase}}/api/payments/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Verify reconciliation no longer cascades ProviderProfile.roleCatalogId failure
GET {{apiBase}}/api/payments/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
